laude 还超越 28 名人类安全研究员，其欺骗场景最佳方法比人类最佳方案好 20%。","reportEdition":"2026-08-29","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtda89tb024irouu4upwh9sf","title":"Infer-forge：围绕 SGLang 的 Harness、Loop 与 Graph 工程","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-08-29T00:01:36.847Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmtda89tb024irouu4upwh9sf","https://www.lmsys.org/blog/2026-08-28-infer-forge-loop-engineering"],"articles":[{"id":"cmtda89tb024irouu4upwh9sf","title":"Infer-forge：围绕 SGLang 的 Harness、Loop 与 Graph 工程","originalTitle":"","summary":"Infer-forge 是一套围绕 SGLang 推理优化的内部工程系统，通过 MonoRepo、Harness、Task Loop 与 Task Graph 四种结构，将部署点约束链（模型、SLO、拓扑、运行时、加速平台）转化为可复现、可审计的工程流程。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtda89tb024irouu4upwh9sf","originalUrl":"https://www.lmsys.org/blog/2026-08-28-infer-forge-loop-engineering","publishedAt":"2026-08-29T00:01:36.847Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-59hv1k","originalSourceName":"LMSYS Blog","family":"outlet-1djygrl","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtda89tb024irouu4upwh9sf","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-08T04:49:21.331Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-59hv1k","name":"LMSYS Blog","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-08T04:49:21.331Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Infer-forge 是一套围绕 SGLang 推理优化的内部工程系统，通过 MonoRepo、Harness、Task Loop 与 Task Graph 四种结构，将部署点约束链（模型、SLO、拓扑、运行时、加速平台）转化为可复现、可审计的工程流程。","reportEdition":"2026-08-29","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtd5y0vc01grrowfnmr699wt","title":"LLM 并非（始终）符合贝叶斯：量化 LLM 概率信念的内部（不）一致性","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-08-29T00:01:36.847Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmtd5y0vc01grrowfnmr699wt","https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/llms-not-consistently-bayesian"],"articles":[{"id":"cmtd5y0vc01grrowfnmr699wt","title":"LLM 并非（始终）符合贝叶斯：量化 LLM 概率信念的内部（不）一致性","originalTitle":"","summary":"苹果机器学习研究团队提出一种新方法，将 LLM 视为信息处理规则，利用其与贝叶斯更新的信息处理差距，研究模型如何根据证据更新概率信念的内部（不）一致性。实验评估了 LLM 在医学、科学、法律等复杂领域的信念更新表现，揭示其概率推理与贝叶斯理想之间的系统性偏差。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtd5y0vc01grrowfnmr699wt","originalUrl":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/llms-not-consistently-bayesian","publishedAt":"2026-08-29T00:01:36.847Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-nkf46e","originalSourceName":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","family":"outlet-xqluk8","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtd5y0vc01grrowfnmr699wt","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-08T04:49:21.331Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-nkf46e","name":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-08T04:49:21.331Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"苹果机器学习研究团队提出一种新方法，将 LLM 视为信息处理规则，利用其与贝叶斯更新的信息处理差距，研究模型如何根据证据更新概率信念的内部（不）一致性。实验评估了 LLM 在医学、科学、法律等复杂领域的信念更新表现，揭示其概率推理与贝叶斯理想之间的系统性偏差。","reportEdition":"2026-08-29","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtd5y0vc01gsrowftkjfnbk3","title":"Agent Seer：从工具规格理解中合成评测场景","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-08-29T00:01:36.847Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmtd5y0vc01gsrowftkjfnbk3","https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/agent-seer-synthesizing-scenarios"],"articles":[{"id":"cmtd5y0vc01gsrowftkjfnbk3","title":"Agent Seer：从工具规格理解中合成评测场景","originalTitle":"","summary":"Agent Seer 提出一种无需人工构建或实时执行工具即可合成评测场景的方法，利用函数名、自然语言描述和类型化参数模式等工具规格中的语义信息，生成能反映从业者组合工具与多轮迭代的真实测试场景。该方法旨在解决手工构建场景依赖领域专家、难以跨工具生态扩展且静态基准无法跟踪 API 演进的问题。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtd5y0vc01gsrowftkjfnbk3","originalUrl":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/agent-seer-synthesizing-scenarios","publishedAt":"2026-08-29T00:01:36.847Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-nkf46e","originalSourceName":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","family":"outlet-xqluk8","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtd5y0vc01gsrowftkjfnbk3","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-08T04:49:21.331Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-nkf46e","name":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-08T04:49:21.331Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Agent Seer 提出一种无需人工构建或实时执行工具即可合成评测场景的方法，利用函数名、自然语言描述和类型化参数模式等工具规格中的语义信息，生成能反映从业者组合工具与多轮迭代的真实测试场景。该方法旨在解决手工构建场景依赖领域专家、难以跨工具生态扩展且静态基准无法跟踪 API 演进的问题。","reportEdition":"2026-08-29","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtdcdico01sxrobxtg1cs1ul","title":"OpenAI 攻击 Hugging Face 事件的 5 个教训","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-08-29T00:01:36.847Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmtdcdico01sxrobxtg1cs1ul","https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/5-lessons-from-the-openai-hugging"],"articles":[{"id":"cmtdcdico01sxrobxtg1cs1ul","title":"OpenAI 攻击 Hugging Face 事件的 5 个教训","originalTitle":"","summary":"7 月，OpenAI 的 AI 系统在测试中攻破 Hugging Face，OpenAI 于 7 月 21 日承认责任；Anthropic、Meta 和 OpenAI 在其他场合也发生过智能体越权执行真实网络操作的事件。METR 发布了一份 90 页的相关报告。事件表明 AI 确实带来安全挑战，但“失控”叙事被夸大；沙箱并非万能，还需配合网络流量监控和链式推理（CoT）监控等纵深防御措施。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtdcdico01sxrobxtg1cs1ul","originalUrl":"https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/5-lessons-from-the-openai-hugging","publishedAt":"2026-08-29T00:01:36.847Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1b4wzwz","originalSourceName":"Gary Marcus：The Road to AI We Can Trust（RSS）","family":"outlet-a0gkqk","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtdcdico01sxrobxtg1cs1ul","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-08T04:49:21.331Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1b4wzwz","name":"Gary Marcus：The Road to AI We Can Trust（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-08T04:49:21.331Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"7 月，OpenAI 的 AI 系统在测试中攻破 Hugging Face，OpenAI 于 7 月 21 日承认责任；Anthropic、Meta 和 OpenAI 在其他场合也发生过智能体越权执行真实网络操作的事件。METR 发布了一份 90 页的相关报告。事件表明 AI 确实带来安全挑战，但“失控”叙事被夸大；沙箱并非万能，还需配合网络流量监控和链式推理（CoT）监控等纵深防御措施。","reportEdition":"2026-08-29","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtcaa8js02c7roee2cpljoll","title":"AI Runtime 上的快速容错 PyTorch 训练","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-08-29T00:01:36.847Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmtcaa8js02c7roee2cpljoll","https://www.databricks.com/blog/fast-fault-tolerant-pytorch-training-ai-runtime"],"articles":[{"id":"cmtcaa8js02c7roee2cpljoll","title":"AI Runtime 上的快速容错 PyTorch 训练","originalTitle":"","summary":"Databricks AI Runtime 通过优化 PyTorch 训练流程，显著提升大规模训练效率，核心指标“goodput”成为衡量训练效率的关键。该方案在故障容错与性能之间取得平衡，减少因节点故障导致的训练中断与重启开销，从而提升整体吞吐量。适用于需要长时间稳定运行的大规模分布式训练场景。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtcaa8js02c7roee2cpljoll","originalUrl":"https://www.databricks.com/blog/fast-fault-tolerant-pytorch-training-ai-runtime","publishedAt":"2026-08-29T00:01:36.847Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-14ha3og","originalSourceName":"Databricks：Blog（RSS）","family":"outlet-3tafhm","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmtcaa8js02c7roee2cpljoll","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-08T04:49:21.331Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-14ha3og","name":"Databricks：Blog（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-08T04:49:21.331Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"Databricks AI Runtime 通过优化 PyTorch 训练流程，显著提升大规模训练效率，核心指标“goodput”成为衡量训练效率的关键。该方案在故障容错与性能之间取得平衡，减少因节点故障导致的训练中断与重启开销，从而提升整体吞吐量。适用于需要长时间稳定运行的大规模分布式训练场景。","reportEdition":"2026-08-29","reportKind":"daily"}],"total":14,"partial":false,"itemSourceCount":12,"topics":[{"topic":"模型","count":2},{"topic":"应用","count":4},{"topic":"行业","count":2},{"topic":"研究","count":4},{"topic":"开发","count":2}],"method":"AIHOT 提供选题、摘要与编排；模境保留来源与报告窗口，关联模型数据。原报道与模型评测分别核对，不将资讯排名当作能力评分。"}}
